# Architecture

Layers (top → bottom): Rules → Skills → Agents → Hooks → Runtime Controllers → CLI.

## Boundaries

- Derived runtime state is written only under `.cursor-loop/`.
- Installable Cursor assets live only under `.cursor/`.
- Python packages live under `runtime/` and `sdk/`.
- Never invent product-specific or proprietary project logic in this framework.

Prefer `cle` / `python3 -m cursor_loop` and runtime controllers over ad-hoc scripts.
